    VALUES ('55555555-9776-0000-0000-000000000001', 'dc000009-0000-0000-0000-000000000009', 0, 'Approved Promotional Claims Register: The following promotional claims are officially approved for commercial and marketing use: (1) ''99.9% guaranteed uptime SLA backed by 24/7 dedicated enterprise support'' - Supporting Evidence: Documented infrastructure telemetry and SLA commitment in Product Master Catalogue v4.2. (2) ''Certified SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001, and fully GDPR compliant'' - Supporting Evidence: Independent third-party security audit reports issued Q3 2026. (3) ''System throughput supports 50,000 document governance verifications per hour'' - Supporting Evidence: Official enterprise load-testing benchmark report certified by engineering. (4) ''Military-grade AES-256 encryption at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit'' - Supporting Evidence: Architecture security specification document.', 1, '[-0.004921,0.028646,-0.037433,-0.032688,0.003866,0.029173,0.007205,-0.111597,0.005624,0.003339,-0.021616,0.029525,-0.059050,-0.017399,0.039191,0.007030,0.113355,0.048330,0.031107,0.033919,-0.013884,0.005975,0.039367,-0.044990,0.062389,-0.026889,0.017574,-0.007733,0.038312,0.014762,0.024428,-0.012478,0.000000,0.021441,0.102107,-0.014587,-0.017926,0.001582,-0.006151,0.036906,-0.047627,-0.000176,-0.036555,-0.020914,0.050263,-0.036555,0.002109,-0.003339,-0.030755,-0.021441,-0.047978,0.035676,0.041651,0.008084,0.033216,0.004218,0.001406,0.039367,-0.033391,-0.042003,-0.000351,-0.008436,0.061862,0.007205,-0.009314,-0.075921,-0.028822,-0.061159,0.059577,0.037609,-0.041124,0.058347,0.014060,0.000000,0.023550,-0.024428,-0.005097,-0.006151,0.020035,-0.040597,0.006327,-0.009490,-0.012654,0.027768,-0.121088,0.030404,0.034973,0.004042,-0.022671,0.004218,0.000000,0.011775,0.008611,-0.002812,-0.005272,-0.007381,-0.045166,-0.010193,-0.011072,-0.030052,-0.023198,-0.047802,0.076976,-0.010720,0.031634,0.001406,-0.001933,0.000000,-0.036203,0.001582,-0.032513,-0.018629,0.024956,-0.033216,0.010369,0.03