    VALUES ('55555555-9776-0000-0000-000000000002', 'dc000009-0000-0000-0000-000000000009', 1, 'Qualified Claims vs Unsupported & Prohibited Claims: Claims Requiring Qualifications: (1) Speed and efficiency claims such as ''up to 2x faster verification'' must always include the mandatory qualification: ''when compared to traditional manual review of 50+ page documents; certified by internal productivity benchmark study''. (2) Volume pricing claims must specify: ''applicable exclusively to enterprise contracts exceeding 100 seats''. Prohibited & Unsupported Claims: Claims promising absolute, unsubstantiated guarantees (e.g., ''100% error-free guarantee'', ''foolproof compliance'', ''zero risk guaranteed'', or ''flawless brand protection'') are strictly prohibited under brand governance. Unsupported superiority claims (e.g., ''the only real AI brand solution on Earth'' or ''infinitely superior to all competitors'') are prohibited without certified independent third-party market validation.', 2, '[0.104419,0.019388,-0.028700,-0.001527,-0.062743,0.080147,0.014808,-0.030074,0.001832,0.002595,-0.018625,0.009312,-0.027479,0.018319,0.063507,-0.001679,-0.043355,-0.068392,0.007480,-0.036944,-0.000305,-0.029463,0.181818,-0.010686,-0.009770,0.026410,0.005801,-0.019388,0.015571,-0.042287,0.026868,-0.029921,0.001221,0.007480,-0.074040,-0.028700,0.022288,-0.006870,-0.000763,0.166705,0.022746,-0.027326,0.019083,-0.031448,0.003511,-0.002595,0.064881,-0.012060,0.010228,-0.008549,-0.013434,0.041371,-0.018777,0.022441,0.002901,0.011144,-0.014961,0.040150,-0.029005,-0.063507,-0.015877,-0.006564,-0.013434,-0.000916,0.004427,-0.010381,-0.014350,0.006259,-0.040150,-0.001221,0.015266,0.011755,0.023968,0.040608,-0.003359,-0.026868,-0.001527,0.004580,-0.039692,0.003969,-0.052515,-0.001221,0.034654,0.047019,0.003359,-0.021220,-0.007786,0.001527,0.017861,0.046714,-0.063965,-0.082131,-0.003511,0.009160,-0.030990,-0.039234,-0.011450,0.035264,0.036028,0.003359,-0.005648,-0.027784,-0.029158,-0.0087