    VALUES ('55555555-9776-0000-0000-000000000002', 'dc000010-0000-0000-0000-000000000010', 1, 'Official Corporate Descriptions and Messaging Pillars: 25-Word Official Description: ''Nexora Technologies provides enterprise-grade AI brand governance platforms that deterministically audit content claims against authoritative multi-tier corporate guidelines before publication.'' 50-Word Official Boilerplate: ''Founded to safeguard organisational reputation, Nexora Technologies builds deterministic brand-governance infrastructure. Its flagship platform, ClaimLedger, enables content creators and brand reviewers to verify marketing copy, sales proposals, and corporate communications against strict hierarchical standards in real time.'' Core Messaging Pillars: (1) Deterministic Authority: Multi-tier hierarchy ensures company-wide truth supersedes departmental variants. (2) Seamless Workflow: Instant feedback empowers creators while preserving reviewer authority. (3) Immutable Auditability: Cryptographic logs ensure regulatory compliance.', 2, '[-0.027105,0.023367,0.031965,-0.010094,-0.006356,0.000561,0.093092,-0.117020,0.018319,-0.026918,-0.031218,-0.014955,-0.013459,-0.008786,0.034396,-0.002430,-0.003178,-0.004673,-0.009907,-0.036826,0.005795,0.030470,0.052154,0.026170,0.030657,-0.058323,-0.025984,-0.073277,0.010094,-0.011403,0.011029,0.017945,0.024488,0.013833,0.002991,0.006916,0.002991,-0.004299,0.018693,-0.050098,0.032713,0.053276,0.041312,-0.060192,-0.011403,-0.016450,-0.010655,-0.002430,0.030844,-0.007851,-0.031965,0.051219,0.020189,-0.021497,0.057014,0.006916,0.028788,-0.034209,0.073838,0.004113,-0.063744,0.039817,-0.024675,-0.022806,-0.019441,-0.055706,0.008786,-0.015702,-0.003926,-0.008038,0.030096,0.054023,0.025423,-0.014955,-0.039069,-0.043929,-0.003178,-0.038695,-0.018880,-0.015889,0.001495,-0.023740,-0.005608,0.016637,-0.039256,0.026170,-0.002430,-0.000374,0.072904,-0.016263,0.020002,-0.011403,-0.033087,0.017572,0.057762,-0.027292,0.007290,0.003926,-0.005234,0